/// M30 HISTORY-050 "No deferred: legs plus needles".
/// Source: tests/baseline/t27_release_audit_test.go
/// symbol TestT27NoDeferredMechanismPresent (L166-286):
/// eight structural legs, each pinning a file plus a
/// needle (or an absence vow).
/// Disposition: historical_candidate (this row pins
/// the TestT27NoDeferredMechanismPresent offline pact
/// as reviewable Can facts; the old Go check stays
/// until the integrator retires it after every linked
/// row, variant, environment and control has accepted
/// evidence).
/// Protects (this file): the eight legs in Go order:
/// the numbered pattern plus two allow files, the
/// RETURNING file plus wording, the finally dir plus
/// suffix plus pattern, the Markup file plus spelling,
/// the triplet file plus suite plus fixture, the
/// registry file plus four groups plus pattern plus
/// four words, the std dir plus two names, and the
/// deferral dir plus two files plus stem, with five
/// tallies.
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source lines): pattern
/// pins hold Go raw inner bytes; file pins hold Go
/// quoted bytes or joined dir bytes; word pins hold
/// alternation bytes; counts pin ints tallied from
/// the Go lists.
/// numbered-pattern pins error\s+[0-9] (L172);
/// numbered-allow-1 pins
/// compiler/internal/syntax/declarations_test.go
/// (L174); numbered-allow-2 pins
/// compiler/internal/check/checks_test.go (L175);
/// returning-file pins
/// compiler/internal/sql/cardinality.go (L212);
/// returning-wording pins RETURNING is not admitted
/// (L212); finally-dir pins compiler/internal/syntax
/// (L218 Join); finally-suffix pins *.go (L218);
/// finally-pattern pins \bfinally\b (L230);
/// markup-file pins compiler/internal/syntax/ast.go
/// (L239); markup-spelling pins Markup (L239, absent
/// from ast.go); triplet-file pins
/// compiler/internal/syntax/declarations_test.go
/// (L244); triplet-suite pins
/// TestFileParserRejectsObsoleteAndMalformedGrammar
/// (L244); triplet-fixture pins the sixteen raw
/// bytes (L244, hex in evidence);
/// catalogue-path pins
/// compiler/internal/catalogue/catalogue.json (L256
/// Join); catalogue-group-packages pins packages
/// (L251 plus L262); catalogue-group-types pins
/// types (L252 plus L263); catalogue-group-errors
/// pins errors (L253 plus L264);
/// catalogue-group-operations pins operations (L254
/// plus L265); deferred-pattern pins
/// (?i)bulk|billing|calendar|markup (L257);
/// deferred-word-bulk pins bulk (L257);
/// deferred-word-billing pins billing (L257);
/// deferred-word-calendar pins calendar (L257);
/// deferred-word-markup pins markup (L257); std-dir
/// pins std (L274); std-pkg-billing pins billing
/// (L273); std-pkg-calendar pins calendar (L273);
/// candidate-dir pins
/// tests/baseline/candidates/T26-native-ai/ (L281);
/// candidate-readme pins README.md (L280);
/// candidate-record pins candidate.json (L280);
/// deferr-stem pins deferr (L282);
/// catalogue-group-count pins int (4) from L258-266;
/// deferred-word-count pins int (4) from L257;
/// std-pkg-count pins int (2) from L273;
/// candidate-file-count pins int (2) from L280;
/// leg-count pins int (8) structural legs (the std
/// loop counts apart from the registry loop).
/// Facet map (legs in Go order): numbered-pattern,
/// numbered-allow-1, numbered-allow-2, returning-file,
/// returning-wording, finally-dir, finally-suffix,
/// finally-pattern, markup-file, markup-spelling,
/// triplet-file, triplet-suite, triplet-fixture,
/// catalogue-path, catalogue-group-packages,
/// catalogue-group-types, catalogue-group-errors,
/// catalogue-group-operations, deferred-pattern,
/// deferred-word-bulk, deferred-word-billing,
/// deferred-word-calendar, deferred-word-markup,
/// std-dir, std-pkg-billing, std-pkg-calendar,
/// candidate-dir, candidate-readme, candidate-record,
/// deferr-stem, catalogue-group-count,
/// deferred-word-count, std-pkg-count,
/// candidate-file-count, leg-count.
/// The sweep roots live in
/// history-050-roots-green.can; the run shape plus
/// diagnostics live in history-050-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none (row lists zero variants; default
/// plus seeded drifts only).
/// Environment: one gate (Bun/Go/Git for T01 smoke or
/// generator when applicable); binds at P23, requires
/// [] now (offline only).
/// Logical gates SUITE/DOC/FILES/PROC/BUILD/WORK bind
/// at P23; no live run now. Accept needs a reviewed
/// disposition; P23 binds only if retained live.
/// Timeout 120000ms is the offline default bound (no
/// Go timeout in this row; binds at P23 like the M11
/// no-gate rows).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (reviewed
/// disposition unmet).
/// Case history/t27-no-deferred-base checks: numbered-pattern,
/// numbered-allow-1, numbered-allow-2, returning-file,
/// returning-wording, finally-dir, finally-suffix,
/// finally-pattern, markup-file, markup-spelling, triplet-file,
